r_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"上自爲太子，受尚書於桓榮，及卽帝位，猶尊榮以師禮。嘗幸太常府，令榮坐東面，設几杖，會百官及榮門生數百人，上親自執業；諸生或避位發難，上謙曰：「太師在是。」旣罷，悉以太官供具賜太常家。榮每疾病，帝輒遣使者存問，太官、太醫相望於道。及篤，上疏謝恩，讓還爵土。帝幸其家問起居，入街，下車，擁經而前，撫榮垂涕，賜以牀茵、帷帳、刀劍、衣被，良久乃去。自是諸侯、將軍、大夫問疾者，不敢復乘車到門，皆拜牀下。榮卒，帝親自變服臨喪送葬，賜冢塋于首山之陽。子郁當嗣，讓其兄子汎；帝不許，郁乃受封，而悉以租入與之。帝以郁爲侍中。","content_fanyi":"汉明帝从做太子时起，就向桓荣学习《尚书》；等到登上帝位以后，仍然用师礼尊奉桓荣。汉明帝曾亲临太常府，让桓荣面朝东而坐，陈设几案和手杖，召集百官以及桓荣的门生数百人，亲自捧着经书听讲；诸生中有人离座提出疑难，明帝谦让地说：‘太师在这里。’事后，把太官所备的御膳全部赐给太常家。桓荣每次生病，明帝总是派遣使者慰问，太官、太医在路上往来不绝。到病势沉重时，桓荣上疏感谢恩德，请求归还爵位和食邑。明帝亲临桓荣家中问候起居，一进入街巷就下车，捧着经书上前，抚摸着桓荣流泪，赐给他床褥、帷帐、刀剑、衣被，很久才离去。从此，前来探病的诸侯、将军、大夫，不敢再乘车直抵门前，都在床下跪拜。桓荣去世，明帝亲自换上丧服临吊、送葬，把首阳山南麓赐作墓地。桓荣的儿子桓郁应当继承爵位，却要让给兄长之子桓汎；明帝不答应，桓郁才接受封爵，而将封邑的租税全部送给桓汎。明帝任命桓郁为侍中。","content_jianti_auto":"上自为太子，受尚书于桓荣，及即帝位，犹尊荣以师礼。尝幸太常府，令荣坐东面，设几杖，会百官及荣门生数百人，上亲自执业；诸生或避位发难，上谦曰：「太师在是。」既罢，悉以太官供具赐太常家。荣每疾病，帝辄遣使者存问，太官、太医相望于道。及笃，上疏谢恩，让还爵土。帝幸其家问起居，入街，下车，拥经而前，抚荣垂涕，赐以床茵、帷帐、刀剑、衣被，良久乃去。自是诸侯、将军、大夫问疾者，不敢复乘车到门，皆拜床下。荣卒，帝亲自变服临丧送葬，赐冢茔于首山之阳。子郁当嗣，让其兄子泛；帝不许，郁乃受封，而悉以租入与之。帝以郁为侍中。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3523,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94f7b6e6-db0e-11ef-9876-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94f9510b-db0e-11ef-98fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"胡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94f9510c-db0e-11ef-83ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：漢官儀：騶騎，王家名官騎。余據焉傳，時賜以北軍胡騎百人，便兵善射。騶，側尤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：汉官仪：驺骑，王家名官骑。余据焉传，时赐以北军胡骑百人，便兵善射。驺，侧尤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"94f9510a-db0e-11ef-acec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"數，所角翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"数，所角翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"94f9510f-db0e-11ef-bb4e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"虎賁","official_note":"虎賁是汉代禁卫军的一种，负责宫廷护卫，此处作为赏赐给中山王焉的仪仗部队，显示其特殊恩宠。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"賜以虎賁、官騎","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"92a23e8a-cf16-4def-ba8e-eb8eea5ab445"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"官騎","official_note":"官騎是汉代官方的骑兵部队，此处作为赏赐给中山王焉的军事力量，增强其护卫能力。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"賜以虎賁、官騎","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"1c3152a8-1c62-46aa-b81e-e443df59fe34"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":194,"link_td_description":"刘焉，字君郎（《华阳国志校补图注》云当字君朗），江夏竟陵（今湖北省天门市）人，东汉末年割据军阀之一，官至阳城侯、益州牧。","link_td_id":"Q10000570","link_td_number_id":225337,"people_name":"中山王","people_name_jianti_auto":"中山王","people_xingming":"刘焉","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94f95110-db0e-11ef-a4ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":194,"link_td_description":"刘焉，字君郎（《华阳国志校补图注》云当字君朗），江夏竟陵（今湖北省天门市）人，东汉末年割据军阀之一，官至阳城侯、益州牧。","link_td_id":"Q10000570","link_td_number_id":225337,"people_name":"焉","people_name_jianti_auto":"焉","people_xingming":"刘焉","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94f95111-db0e-11ef-8cc2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":6,"link_death_year":52,"link_td_description":"郭圣通，为东汉光武帝刘秀的第二任妻子和首任皇后，真定槀县人，其父阳安思侯郭昌，其母为真定恭王刘普之女，号为郭主。","link_td_id":"Q10001464","link_td_number_id":520745,"people_name":"郭太后","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭太后","people_xingming":"郭圣通","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"94f95112-db0e-11ef-9d61-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[郭圣通]"},{"link_birth_year":5,"link_death_year":64,"link_td_description":"阴丽华，南阳郡新野县（今河南新野）人。东汉光武帝刘秀第一任妻子，第二任皇后。汉明帝刘庄的生母。","link_td_id":"Q10000628","link_td_number_id":133680,"people_name":"陰","people_name_jianti_auto":"阴","people_xingming":"阴太后之子","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"94f95114-db0e-11ef-8a6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":6,"link_death_year":52,"link_td_description":"郭圣通，为东汉光武帝刘秀的第二任妻子和首任皇后，真定槀县人，其父阳安思侯郭昌，其母为真定恭王刘普之女，号为郭主。","link_td_id":"Q10001464","link_td_number_id":520745,"people_name":"郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭","people_xingming":"郭太后之子","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"94f95115-db0e-11ef-b426-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"94f95113-db0e-11ef-acc2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"94f95116-db0e-11ef-984e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3上以中山王焉，郭太后少子，太后尤愛之，故獨留京師，至是始與諸王俱就國，賜以虎賁、官騎，恩寵尤厚，獨得往來京師。帝禮待陰、郭，每事必均，數受賞賜，恩寵俱渥。","content_fanyi":"汉明帝因为中山王刘焉是郭太后的小儿子，阴太后尤其喜爱他，所以将他单独留在京城；到这时，他才与诸王一同前往封国，明帝赐给他虎贲卫士和官骑，恩宠特别优厚，只有他可以随时往来京城。汉明帝对阴太后和郭太后都以礼相待，每件事都同等对待，她们多次受到赏赐，恩宠都很优厚。","content_jianti_auto":"3上以中山王焉，郭太后少子，太后尤爱之，故独留京师，至是始与诸王俱就国，赐以虎贲、官骑，恩宠尤厚，独得往来京师。帝礼待阴、郭，每事必均，数受赏赐，恩宠俱渥。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3524,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94f95109-db0e-11ef-bd16-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-257,"link_death_year":-193,"link_td_description":"萧何，沛县（今中国江苏省沛县）人。是汉朝初年丞相、政治家。封爵酇侯，谥号文终，汉初三杰之一。辅助汉高祖刘邦建立汉政权。","link_td_id":"Q10000053","link_td_number_id":93952,"people_name":"蕭何","people_name_jianti_auto":"萧何","people_xingming":"萧何","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94f95118-db0e-11ef-9e9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-68,"link_td_description":"霍光，字子孟，西汉河东郡平阳县（今山西省临汾市）人，政治家，麒麟阁十一功臣之首，名将霍去病异母弟，昭帝上官皇后外祖父，宣帝霍皇后之父。","link_td_id":"Q10006237","link_td_number_id":81818,"people_name":"霍光","people_name_jianti_auto":"霍光","people_xingming":"霍光","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"94f95119-db0e-11ef-a7a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94f9511a-db0e-11ef-b9b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","resolved_place_entity_id":105,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"94f9511b-db0e-11ef-ab50-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4甲子，上行幸長安。十一月，甲申，遣使者以中牢祠蕭何、霍光，帝過，式其墓。進幸河東；癸卯，還宮。","content_fanyi":"十月十七日甲子，汉明帝前往长安。十一月初七日甲申，朝廷派使者用中牢祭品祭祀萧何、霍光，明帝经过他们的墓地，在车上手扶车轼俯身致敬。随后继续巡幸河东郡；十一月二十六日癸卯，明帝返回宫中。","content_jianti_auto":"4甲子，上行幸长安。十一月，甲申，遣使者以中牢祠萧何、霍光，帝过，式其墓。进幸河东；癸卯，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3525,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94f95117-db0e-11ef-bc9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"滇吾","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇吾","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"94f9511e-db0e-11ef-927f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇岸","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇岸","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94f9511f-db0e-11ef-bf91-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"林","people_name_jianti_auto":"林","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94f95120-db0e-11ef-8013-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇岸","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇岸","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94f95121-db0e-11ef-9464-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇吾","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇吾","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"94f95122-db0e-11ef-b74d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"林","people_name_jianti_auto":"林","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94f95123-db0e-11ef-9e2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"林","people_name_jianti_auto":"林","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"94f95124-db0e-11ef-8b40-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"林","people_name_jianti_auto":"林","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"94f95125-db0e-11ef-9a29-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"林","people_name_jianti_auto":"林","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"94f95126-db0e-11ef-a10b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94f95127-db0e-11ef-910b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"94f95128-db0e-11ef-a639-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"時羌滇吾叛，滇岸來降，林奏以滇岸爲大豪。後滇吾復降，林又奏其爲第一豪。帝怪其一種兩豪，以詰林，窮驗，知之，怒而免林官。涼州刺史又奏林臧罪，遂下獄死。下，遐稼翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"时羌滇吾叛，滇岸来降，林奏以滇岸为大豪。后滇吾复降，林又奏其为第一豪。帝怪其一种两豪，以诘林，穷验，知之，怒而免林官。凉州刺史又奏林臧罪，遂下狱死。下，遐稼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"94f9511d-db0e-11ef-8799-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94fa0121-db0e-11ef-81a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安豐","people_name_jianti_auto":"安丰","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94fa0122-db0e-11ef-9aba-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顯親","people_name_jianti_auto":"显亲","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"94fa0123-db0e-11ef-8976-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"融","people_name_jianti_auto":"融","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"94fa0124-db0e-11ef-8df2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"94fa0125-db0e-11ef-a95a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"內黃公主","people_n